{"title":"Glimmerfox","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 41 Moonbeast that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 6 times (0.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonhart-antler\">Moonhart Antler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>17</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>33</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>1,589</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>1,457</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>117</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>64</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>35</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-t